+| USDT | Base | `0xfde4C96c8593536E31F229EA8f37b2ADa2699bb2` | 6 | `https://mainnet.base.org` | basescan.org |
+| USDC | Base | `0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913` | 6 | `https://mainnet.base.org` | basescan.org |
